盜擊王，王走鄖。鄖公弟懷曰：「平王殺我父，我殺其子，不亦可乎！」鄖公恐其弟殺王，與王奔隨。吳兵圍隨，謂隨人曰：「周之子孫在漢川者，楚盡滅之。」隨人欲殺王，王子綦匿王，己自為王以當之。隨人卜與王於吳，不吉，乃謝吳不與王。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示姓名及局部敘事暫接異稱：公子光自立為闔廬、軫立為昭王、勝號白公；王稱隨敘事主體分段。王子綦佯充王不接昭王，與後文司馬子綦暫分候選但不斷言異人。悼公與陽生按本文分存，矛盾待版本覆核；鮑氏不強接鮑牧。未名父子只按本段明示保存，不補姓名。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p012","text":"昭王出亡，入雲夢；盜擊王，王走鄖。鄖公弟懷曰：「平王殺我父，我殺其子，不亦可乎！」鄖公恐其弟殺王，與王奔隨。吳兵圍隨，謂隨人曰：「周之子孫在漢川者，楚盡滅之。」隨人欲殺王，王子綦匿王，己自為王以當之。隨人卜與王於吳，不吉，乃謝吳不與王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m012-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003817","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m012-0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"盜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名及成員；鮑氏不直接等同鮑牧。"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m012-0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003817","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m012-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003817","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m012-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"鄖公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003835","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m012-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"懷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003836","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m012-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003813","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m012-0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003859","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m012-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"鄖公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003835","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m012-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003817","status":"contextual_provisional"